            %p
              for its
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holomorphic+de+Rham+complex"} holomorphic de Rham complex
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              Notice the
              %a{:href => "holomorphic+de+Rham+complex#RelationToComplexCohomology"} relation to complex cohomology
              given by
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi H
